id":"p9s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**AGENTS.md is now an industry standard in 2026** — used by 60,000+ open-source repos, co-promoted b"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"y OpenAI, Google, Anthropic, and Microsoft. 76% of developers use AI coding assistants (Stack Overfl"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ow 2025), but without AGENTS.md, AI agents are like \"new hires with no onboarding\" — producing incon"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"sistent code styles, broken architecture, and failing CI."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Industry data**: Anthropic benchmarks show AGENTS.md reduces wrong-pattern rewrites by **40-60%**."},{"id":"p11s2","text":" But writing a quality AGENTS.md by hand takes half a day to a full day — repeated for every new pro"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"writing a quality AGENTS.md by hand takes half a day to a full day — repeated for every new project."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Project Blueprint's approach**: No preset templates. Autonomous scanning → intelligent classificat"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ion → dynamic assembly. The AGENTS.md you get reflects your project's actual tech stack. And it's th"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"e only tool that generates AGENTS.md + docs skeleton + CI pipeline + testing policy + Git convention"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"s — all from one sentence."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Core Capabilities"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **Autonomous File Discovery** | Scan and classify 30+ file patterns — no preset file checklist |\n|"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" **Project Structure Detection** | Auto-identify monorepo, 2/3-tier frontend-backend, or single proj"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ect |\n| **Monorepo Nested AGENTS.md** | Root `AGENTS.md` (global constraints + sub-project index) + "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"per-package `AGENTS.md` (closest-file-wins) when ≥2 build/manifest files |\n| **Intelligent Dep Class"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ification** | 3-tier: knowledge base exact match → 29 heuristic patterns → web search |\n